      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>This policy covers the website dataleasers.com and the enquiries you send through it. It is provided by Data Leasers, LLC. Contact us at <a href="mailto:info@dataleasers.com">info@dataleasers.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you use the "Request a call back" form, we collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>your name, work email address and company name;</li>
        <li>your job title, if you give it;</li>
        <li>any description of the data you hold, if you choose to write one.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Please do not put personal data about other people, or confidential datasets, into the form. Describe the data in general terms and we will discuss the detail on a call.</p>

      <h2>Why we use it</h2>
      <p>We use your details to reply to your enquiry, arrange a call, and discuss whether and how we can help with your data. Where we store your details as a business contact, we do so because we have a legitimate interest in managing that relationship, and you can object at any time.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We do not sell personal information. Your details are stored with our CRM hosting provider (Supabase) and on our own server. Access is limited to staff who need it for your enquiry. We will not share your details with a data buyer or AI company without your written approval.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry details while we are in contact with you and for a short period afterwards, so we can follow up. You can ask us to delete your details at any time. Closed records that contain company information are kept only as long as needed for our records.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>tell you what personal information we hold about you;</li>
        <li>correct information that is wrong;</li>
        <li>delete your information;</li>
        <li>stop contacting you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:info@dataleasers.com">info@dataleasers.com</a>. We will reply within a reasonable time and confirm when a deletion is complete.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>The public website does not set tracking cookies. If this changes, this policy will be updated before the change takes effect.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We will update this page when our practices change and show the new date at the top.</p>

      <p>See also our <a href="consent.html">consent and contact preferences</a> and <a href="trust.html">how we handle data</a>.</p>
